From e77d5774d8e4f3b8c5b9f005bb7703cec1d4b0a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 02:16:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): retain retired pin author diagnostics and
 consumer contracts [daveey]

Retirement keeps prior policy evidence in its audit rather than task columns. Read that evidence only under the existing conservative first-epoch rules; class policy, downstream-review exclusions and later concrete implementation epochs retain their previous behavior. Keep routing/admission/custody assertions while replacing superseded storage expectations.

Proof: full pre-fix consumer suite 22570 passed/28 failed; new provenance suite RED 3 failures then GREEN 14 cases; eight exact-anchor provenance mutations killed. Revised 15-file consumer suite green; importer/history suites green; scripts/check --base origin/main green. Independent exact-head review and required CI remain canonical ship gates.
